\begin_layout Section
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "sec:The-GiveDirectly-Unconditional"

\end_inset

The 
\emph on
GiveDirectly
\emph default
 Unconditional Cash Transfer Program
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard

\emph on
GiveDirectly, Inc.
 
\emph default
(
\shape italic
GD
\shape default
; 
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
name "www.givedirectly.org"
target "http://givedirectly.org/"

\end_inset

) is an international NGO founded in 2009 whose mission is to make unconditional
 cash transfers to poor households in developing countries.
 
\emph on
GD
\emph default
 began operations in Kenya in 2011 
\begin_inset ERT
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
shortcite{nyt2013}
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
 At the time of the study, eligibility was determined by living in a house
 with a thatched (rather than metal) roof.
\begin_inset Foot
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout

\emph on
GD 
\emph default
had independently established this eligibility criterion as predictive of
 poverty.
 We confirm that metal-roof ownership correlates positively with expenditure
 and asset holdings by comparing our baseline households to a sample of
 two metal-roof households in every treatment village surveyed at baseline
 (Online Appendix Table 4).
\end_layout

\end_inset

 Such households were identified through a census conducted with the help
 of the village elder.
 After identification, recipient households were visited by a representative
 of 
\emph on
GD
\emph default
, who asked to speak to the transfer recipient in private, collected some
 demographics, and informed the recipient that they would receive a transfer
 of KES 25,200 (USD 404 PPP).
 Recipients were told that the transfer was unconditional, and they were
 informed about the transfer schedule (lump-sum vs.
 monthly) and the one-time nature of the transfer.
 Recipients were provided with a 
\emph on
Safaricom 
\emph default
SIM card and asked to register for the mobile money service 
\emph on
M-Pesa.
\begin_inset Foot
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
The treatment is thus a combination of cash transfers and encouragement
 to register for 
\emph on
M-Pesa
\emph default
.
 We discuss the possible effects of 
\emph on
M-Pesa
\emph default
 access on outcomes in Section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "subsec:Effects-of-M-Pesa"

\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\end_inset

 
\emph default
Registration had to occur in the name of the designated transfer recipient.
 For lump sum recipients, an initial transfer of KES 1,200 (USD 19 PPP)
 was sent on the first of the month following the initial 
\emph on
GD
\emph default
 visit as an incentive to register.
\begin_inset Foot
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout

\emph on
GD
\emph default
's operating model has changed since the time of the study.
 Eligibility is now based not only on a census conducted with a village
 guide, but is additionally verified by physical back-checks, data back-checks,
 and crowd-sourced labor to confirm recipient identity and thatched-roof
 ownership.
 Transfer amounts are now USD 1,000 (nominal) per household (corresponding
 to the 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

large
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 transfer amount in the present study), and 
\emph on
all
\emph default
 eligible households in a village receive transfers.
\end_layout

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Withdrawals and deposits can be made at any 
\emph on
M-Pesa
\emph default
 agent, of which 
\emph on
Safaricom 
\emph default
operated about 11,000 throughout Kenya at the time of the study.
 
\emph on
GD 
\emph default
estimates the average travel time and cost from recipient households to
 the nearest 
\emph on
M-Pesa
\emph default
