\begin_layout Standard
The costs of the 
\emph on
GD 
\emph default
program at the time of the study amounted to USD 81 (nominal) per household.
 Given the proportions of large and small transfers sent at the time, this
 figure translates to a cost of USD 113 (nominal) per household for a large
