status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
shortcite{radloff_ces-d_1977}
\end_layout

\end_inset

, a custom worries questionnaire (negatively coded), Cohen's stress scale
 (
\begin_inset ERT
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
shortciteNP{cohen_global_1983}
\end_layout

\end_inset

; negatively coded), their response to the the World Values Survey happiness
