\begin_layout Standard
We test for baseline differences between treatment and control groups using
 the following specification:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
y_{vhiB}=\alpha_{v}+\beta_{0}+\beta_{1}T_{vh}+\varepsilon_{vhiB}\label{eq:baselinebalance}
\end{equation}

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Here, 
\begin_inset Formula $y_{vhiB}$
\end_inset

 is the outcome of interest for household 
\begin_inset Formula $h$
\end_inset

 in village 
\begin_inset Formula $v$
\end_inset

, measured at baseline, of individual 
\begin_inset Formula $i$
\end_inset

 (subscript 
