\begin_layout Subsubsection
Pre-analysis plans
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
A goal of this study was to provide a comprehensive picture of the impacts
 of unconditional cash transfers on households.
 We therefore collected a large number of outcomes and endeavor in this
 paper to report the full breadth of the evidence.
 To ensure no cherry-picking of results from these many outcomes, we wrote
 a pre-analysis plan (PAP) for this study, which is published and time-stamped
 at 
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
target "https://www.socialscienceregistry.org/trials/19"

\end_inset

 (
